rienced product leaders, you will help bridge communication between our AI/R&amp;D team, software &amp; hardware engineering, solutions architects, and customers — assisting in translating real-world operational complexity into scalable product requirements.</p><h1><strong>Your Responsibilities:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product Strategy &amp; Roadmap Support</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist in maintaining and updating the product roadmap across hardware, software, AI, and field reliability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support priority alignment — monthly to annual — in accordance with commercial goals and technical constraints</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI &amp; Technical Ownership</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with the R&amp;D team to help refine training data strategies, model evaluation criteria, and deployment thresholds</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help collect and analyze field failure data to feed back into Cortex training models</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer &amp; Field Collaboration</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spend time at production sites; turn operator observations and edge cases into structured requirements</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist in drafting capability specs, performance SLAs, and integration requirements for customer-facing delivery</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cross-functional Execution</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support backlog management; help prioritize items by impact, frequency, &amp; strategic fit</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate with engineering leads to track task completion, identify dependencies, and maintain momentum</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track KPIs: uptime, pick success rate, i