urate record</strong> of every conversation and outcome in our CRM, your data shapes decisions beyond your own pipeline</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Feed customer and market signal directly into our GTM strategy</strong>, your read on the market changes how we approach it, not just how you execute it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Track industry shifts </strong>and translate them into sharper positioning over time</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>🤝 Your Skillset – What you bring to the table</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>First experience in B2B sales</strong>, preferably in SaaS or tech environments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Confidence in conducting cold calls</strong> and handling rejection professionally</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Curiosity</strong> to understand customer needs and match them with our solution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Excellent communication skills:</strong> You know how to get to the point and make complex topics easy to understand</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical affinity:</strong> Comfortable working with tools like HubSpot, Google Workspace, Slack, and Notion.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fluent in German (C2),</strong> to effectively support our German customer base and a good command of English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Based in/close to Berlin</strong> - or willing to relocate. </p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>🌱 Growing together – what you can expect at voize</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A 70/30 base-to-commission split, ahead of the 60/40 industry standard, because we build compensation the same way we build product, with conviction, not caution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real influence over how the SDR function itsel