ts can be covered for appropriate assets via Tangany's crypto custody license if required. For our continued growth, we are looking for a <strong>Head of Growth (f/m/d)</strong> to join our team.</p><h2>Your role</h2><p>In this role, you own business development and lead our Sales and Marketing teams, reporting directly to our Co-CEO. You work closely with Product, Legal, and Compliance. The role is deliberately broad: you are here to build what does not exist yet, not to administer what does.</p><h2>Tasks</h2><ul><li><p>Lead Sales & Key Account Management directly, plus Marketing and Business Development: set shared targets, define the handover from demand generation to pipeline, and make performance measurable.</p></li><li><p>Build the internal processes a growing go-to-market organisation needs, including planning, forecasting, target systems, and reporting that gives management a reliable view of pipeline, conversion, and marketing contribution.</p></li><li><p>Define product and pricing standards, such as price models and discount guidelines, together with our Head of Products, and ensure they are applied consistently.</p></li><li><p>Feed structured market signals (recurring customer needs, lost-deal reasons, unserved demand) into product innovation, prioritized with Product and the C-Level.</p></li><li><p>Build out stablecoins and institutional tokenization custody solutions and open up new customer segments, from market validation to a repeatable route to market.</p></li><li><p>Own business development: partnerships, channels, strategic accounts, and complex B2B deals with long cycles and regulated counterparties.</p></li><li><p>Represent Tangany at management level towards clients, partners, and the ecosystem, including at industry events.</p></li><li><p>Act as our thought leader on a focus topic, with Marketing supporting your visibility.</p></li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><p>8+ years in B2B growth, business development, or commercial roles, ideally i