<ul>
<li>Put people first. We only succeed when our people succeed.</li>
<li>Ethics and integrity always. Be open, honest, and respectful of everyone.</li>
<li>Think Big. Be ambitious and have audacious goals.</li>
<li>Aim for excellence. Quality and excellence count in everything we do.</li>
<li>Own it and get it done. Results matter!</li>
<li>Make each person better together than they would be as an individual.</li>
