&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working closely with the Director of Video, you’ll help define and deliver the department’s slate of shows — from the first spark of an idea through development, pilots and launch. You’ll executive produce a range of shows, working closely with producers to make the work as strong as possible, while also taking direct ownership of a limited number of productions yourself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
