&lt;p&gt;Work happens close to the technology, with engineers expected to investigate deeply, speak up and take ownership. The team uses Agile ways of working to keep progress visible and decisions moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate across software, firmware and hardware teams to identify debug feature opportunities. Decisions are shaped by technical evidence, user needs and the judgement of engineers closest to the problem.&lt;/p&gt;
