&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that all communications from our recruiting team come from an ----- email address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remember, employers will &lt;strong&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; request payment or banking information during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you receive a suspicious message, &lt;strong&gt;do not respond&lt;/strong&gt; — instead, forward it to &lt;a ---------- and/or report it to the platform where you received it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your safety and security are important to us. Thank you for staying vigilant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/banyansoftware/director-ma-france-paris-paris-172963","tags":["M&A"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris, Paris","created_at":1793051728},{"slug":"remote-senior-backend-engineer-paris-287438","company_name":"Payflows","title":"Senior Backend Engineer","description":"<h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">About Payflows</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#000000">At Payflows, we build software that helps large companies manage and automate their payment workflows. It’s not the flashiest part of a business, but it’s one of the most critical: invoices, approvals, payments, and controls. When these things slow down, the whole company feels it.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">But our ambition goes further than just building a better workflow tool.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We believe the future of finance operations is not faster clicking: it’s </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">no clicking at all</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> 🫳&nbsp;🎤</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Finance teams shouldn’t spend their days moving data from one screen to another. Software should do the operational work, and humans should focus on reviewing, approving, and making the decisions that matter.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">That’s the direction we’re building toward: an </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">agent-driven finance platform</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, where intelligent agents handle the repetitive tasks, and users stay in control.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We started in 2022 with a small team and a rough first version of the product. Three years later, we’re working with major companies across France, the UK, and the US while choosing to keep our team small and human-sized.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We moved fast, shipped a lot, and not everything was built in a perfect way. But it helped us learn quickly, sign real customers, and prove that the problem we’re solving truly matters.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">In 2024, investors trusted us with a $25M Series A. That gives us the chance to keep growing while also strengthening our foundations and building the system that will power this agent-driven future.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Today, we’re about 35 people from many different countries, and we’re looking for a few amazing humans to join the next chapter. 🤗</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">🚀 What you’ll actually do</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#000000">You’ll help build a product that real finance teams rely on every day.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">For us, engineering is not just about clean code, it’s about reliability, clarity, and trust, especially when money and automation are involved.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">In a typical week, you might:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Design and implement new services for a product feature.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Refactor an early service to make it more robust.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Investigate a performance or production issue.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Work with product and frontend to shape a new feature.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Review code and help teammates improve.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Build backend tools that our AI agents use to perform real finance operations.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Design safe, deterministic workflows where agents propose actions and humans review them.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Your time will be split between </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">building new features</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> and </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">improving what already exists</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">. Both matter.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You won’t just build endpoints. You’ll help shape the </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">execution layer</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> that our agents rely on: the APIs, data models, and workflows that let them act safely in production.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You’ll work closely with product, frontend, and customer-facing teams. We expect engineers to take ownership of parts of the system and help make them more reliable over time.</span></p><h4></h4><h4><span style="color:#121317">💻</span><strong><span style="color:#000000"> Our current tech reality</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#000000">Our stack evolves based on our challenges, but we care more about good design than trendy tools 🙏</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Python is our core language. It helps us move fast, keep the code readable, and fits naturally with our AI-driven approach. A growing part of the system is built around agents that use our backend as a set of reliable, deterministic tools.</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Core language:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Python</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Backend:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> FastAPI + Pydantic</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Data:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> PostgreSQL</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Infra:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> AWS, serverless when it makes sense</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Performance:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> some Rust for critical paths</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Architecture:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> multi-service backend, simple enough to reason about</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Some parts of the system are clean and well-tested. Others were built quickly and need love. That’s the phase we’re in.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Over the next year, we’ll focus on:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Turning core workflows into reliable tools for our agents</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Simplifying services</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Improving tests and observability</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Making performance more predictable</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Cleaning up early code</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#000000">We know we’re not perfect, but we care a lot about improving step by step.</span></p> <br> <h4><span style="color:#121317">✨</span><strong><span style="color:#121317"> Who’s going to thrive with us</span></strong></h4><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">You’ll probably feel comfortable here if:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You like building products people actually use.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You are autonomous and take ownership of what you ship.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You take initiative and lead by example.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You’re curious and enjoy figuring things out.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You’re pragmatic about trade-offs.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You communicate with kindness and clarity.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">This role is a great fit if you’re excited by the idea of:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Building systems that are used by AI agents, not just humans.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Designing reliable, safe automation in production.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Working on a product that is still early and evolving quickly.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#121317">You don’t need to know everything about AI. But you should be curious about it and excited to work in a system where agents are part of the core product 🤖</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">🧩 What you’ll get from this role</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Real ownership over parts of the system.</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Direct impact on customers and product decisions.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A small, human team where your work is visible and meaningful 🤝</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A mix of feature work, system design, and technical improvements.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Exposure to real scaling and production challenges.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">The chance to help build an agent-driven product from the inside.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">We offer:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Competitive salary and equity.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Flexible remote setup (we prefer people to come into Paris or London office twice per </span>week. At a minimum we’d <span style="color:#121317">ask you to be at an office 3 days per month, onboard in Paris for your first few weeks, and work CEST timezone).</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A high-autonomy environment where you have real ownership and space to make an impact.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Plenty of room to grow, take responsibility, and shape parts of the product.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A culture based on trust, ownership, and clear communication.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">This isn’t a huge corporate environment. In exchange, you get autonomy, responsibility, and the chance to shape a product that’s still early in its story—and help build what finance operations will look like in the next decade 🚀</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/payflows/remote-senior-backend-engineer-paris-287438","tags":["Tech","Remote"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1793051489},{"slug":"french-speaking-account-executive-paris-436662","company_name":"Payflows","title":"French-Speaking Account Executive","description":"<p>AI is rewriting how enterprises run. Payflows is the platform making it happen.</p><p>The world’s largest companies are held back by complexity — disconnected systems, slow approvals, and manual workflows across Finance, Procurement, and Operations.</p><p>Payflows is building the <strong>AI-native Finance OS for enterprise</strong> — connecting every process, person, and system so work just flows.</p><p>Approvals route automatically, payments execute intelligently, and leaders gain real-time visibility into how, when, and why payments are made.</p><p>In a world where speed, control, and intelligence define competitive advantage, Payflows enables global enterprises to operate with precision — powered by AI. One intelligent platform, endless possibilities.</p> <br> <p>We're looking for the next MJ to double-down on our momentum across 🇪🇺!</p><p><strong>🗺️ Context:</strong><br>We are selling a B2B SaaS product dedicated to buyer personas like: CFOs, head of treasury, VP of finance to help them manage their end-to-end finance topics (procurement, treasury…). You will handle a complex sell cycle that lasts on average 3 months.</p><p>Within this context, having accounting or financial notions is a big plus that will help you ramp up faster and feel more comfortable in calls and demos.</p><p><strong>🧑‍🚀 Your mission:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Lead and achieve sales targets by winning new logos</p></li><li><p>Manage the full sales cycle, from prospecting to contract closure</p></li><li><p>Shape a consistent pipeline generation engine</p></li><li><p>Plan your pipeline activities to support the company growth with consistence</p></li><li><p>Use a data-driven approach utilizing Hubspot and other tools to track progress proactively</p></li><li><p>Build strong relationships with multiple stakeholders you’ll meet during the sales cycle (C-Level, Business, Users and IT)</p></li><li><p>Demonstrate our value proposition to our prospects, handle demonstration</p></li><li><p>Participate in renowned financial events and act as an ambassador within the financial community</p></li><li><p>Collaborating closely with your BRD and the rest of the team to solve problems</p></li></ul><p><strong>Preferred experience</strong></p><ul><li><p>You already have a demonstrated experience working for a B2B SaaS product and selling to C-Levels buyer personas: you are comfortable driving negotiation and closing deals. Minimum 3+ closing experience.</p></li><li><p>You are organized, methodical, and have a taste for documenting sales playbook</p></li><li><p>You are able to deal with uncertainty and are comfortable handling multiple stakeholders during a sell cycle, including business units and IT teams</p></li><li><p>You understands the value of utilizing best in class methodologies when building pipeline and qualifying opportunities</p></li><li><p>You are a team player, and enjoy collaborating with product teams and tech teams</p><p>You speak both French and English fluently</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/payflows/french-speaking-account-executive-paris-436662","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Paris, Île-de-France, France","created_at":1793051489},{"slug":"devops-infra-lead-paris-224625","company_name":"Payflows","title":"DevOps / Infra Lead","description":"<h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">🌍 Our Vision &amp; Mission</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#121317">At Payflows, we give finance teams the tools to reclaim their time and energy. Our platform weaves together banking connectivity, payments, AI, and procurement so they can ditch the busywork and focus on what really moves the needle.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">🤝 Why Join Us?</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#121317">We’re a small, mighty team who’ve earned our stripes at Airbnb, Luko, BNP Paribas, and Facebook. It’s not always easy—things move fast, and we expect a lot—but if you’re hungry for impact, you’ll find it here.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">🛠️ We’re builders at heart. We move fast, think deeply, ship often — and we’re always hungry to learn more. You'll collaborate closely with product and tech to craft elegant backend systems that scale as fast as we do.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">🚀 What You’ll Do</span></strong></h4><p>You'll own the infrastructure for a product that real finance teams rely on every day.</p><p>For us, infrastructure is not just about uptime; it's about reliability, security, and trust - especially when money and automation are involved. The platform has to be boring in the best possible way: predictable, observable, and safe to deploy to.</p><ul><li><p>In a typical week, you might:</p><ul><li><p>Evolve our infrastructure-as-code to add a service, a queue, or a whole new environment.</p></li><li><p>Improve our CI/CD pipelines so engineers ship safely and fast, dozens of times a day.</p></li><li><p>Investigate a production issue: a latency spike, a failing deploy, a database under load.</p></li><li><p>Strengthen observability with dashboards, alerts, and traces, so we catch problems before customers do.</p></li><li><p>Harden our security, secrets management, and access controls.</p></li><li><p>Tune cost and performance across our AWS footprint.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Your time will be split between&nbsp;<strong>building new platform capabilities</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>making what already exists more reliable</strong>. Both matter.</p><p>You'll help shape the&nbsp;<strong>foundation</strong>&nbsp;that everything else stands on: the pipelines, environments, and guardrails that let engineers and our AI agents act safely in production.</p><p>You'll work closely with backend, frontend, and the AI team. We expect you to take ownership of the platform and make it more reliable over time, not wait for tickets.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>💻 Our current tech reality</strong></h4><p>Our stack evolves based on our challenges, but we care more about good design than trendy tools </p><p>We're an AWS shop, and we lean on managed services and infrastructure-as-code so the system is reproducible and easy to reason with. A growing part of our world is making the backend a set of reliable, deterministic tools that AI agents can call, which raises the bar on reliability even further.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cloud:</strong>&nbsp;AWS</p></li><li><p><strong>Infra-as-code:</strong>&nbsp;Pulumi (Python)</p></li><li><p><strong>Compute:</strong>&nbsp;ECS + Lambda, serverless when it makes sense</p></li><li><p><strong>Data:</strong>&nbsp;PostgreSQL on RDS/Aurora</p></li><li><p><strong>CI/CD:</strong>&nbsp;GitLab CI</p></li><li><p><strong>Orchestration:</strong>&nbsp;Airflow (MWAA)</p></li><li><p><strong>Observability:</strong>&nbsp;Grafana Cloud, CloudWatch, Sentry</p></li><li><p><strong>Auth &amp; identity:</strong>&nbsp;Cognito, IAM</p></li><li><p><strong>Edge &amp; frontend:</strong>&nbsp;API Gateway, ALB, AWS Amplify for the web app</p></li></ul><p>Some of this is clean, version-controlled, and reproducible. Other parts grew fast and live a little too much in people’s heads instead of in code. Closing that gap is a big part of why this role exists.</p><p>Over the next year, we'll focus on:</p><ul><li><p>Making every environment reproducible from code</p></li><li><p>Better observability and alerting, fewer surprises</p></li><li><p>Tightening the security and compliance posture that comes with handling enterprise finance data</p></li><li><p>Faster, safer deploys</p></li><li><p>Keeping AWS costs sane as we scale</p></li></ul> <br> <h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">🧑‍💻 What we’re looking for</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">5+ years of experience with </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">Python</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> or any other OOP language</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Backend expertise</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: APIs, microservices, architecture best practices</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Databases &amp; SQL</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Data modeling, query optimization</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Git lover</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Comfortable with version control and code reviews</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Pragmatic engineering mindset</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Build, test, refine, simplify—smart shortcuts when time is tight</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">🧩 Bonus points if you’ve worked on:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">B2B SaaS or finance/ERP tools</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">BaaS APIs or payment infra</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Serverless, AWS, event-driven architecture exposure</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>✨ Who's going to thrive with us</strong></h4><p><strong>You'll probably feel comfortable here if:</strong></p><ul><li><p>You think in systems and instinctively automate yourself out of repetitive work.</p></li><li><p>You treat infrastructure as code, not as pets.</p></li><li><p>You stay calm during incidents and are genuinely good at root-causing.</p></li><li><p>You care about security, because you're handling other people's money.</p></li><li><p>You are autonomous and take ownership of what you ship.</p></li><li><p>You take initiative and lead by example.</p></li><li><p>You're pragmatic about trade-offs.</p></li><li><p>You communicate with kindness and clarity.</p></li></ul><p>You don't need to know everything about AI - but you must be curious about it and excited to build the reliable foundation that agents run on 🤖</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>🧩 What you'll get from this role</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Real ownership over the platform the whole company runs on.</p></li><li><p>Direct impact on reliability, security, and how fast every engineer can ship.</p></li><li><p>A mix of platform building, system design, and reliability work.</p></li><li><p>Exposure to real scaling and production challenges.</p></li><li><p>The chance to help build the foundation of an agent-driven product from the inside.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4></h4><p>Find more <